        "content": "## Hotel chat (RAG)\nPOST { sessionId, message, name?, email? } to /hotel-chat.\nThe agent searches the hotel knowledge base (Supabase pgvector, filled by hotel-knowledge-ingest), keeps short-term memory per sessionId, and logs every turn to hotel_chat_logs.\nResponse: [{ answer, topic, canAnswer }].\nIf canAnswer is false, the frontend calls /hotel-escalate.",
